<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">It was great talking with you and learning about your business. Your account is now activated and all we need are the following:&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">- Signed 1 Page Application Attached or (Separate Email via DocuSign)&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">- Last 3 Months of Business Bank Statements&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">- Proof of Annual Gross Sales (1st page of business tax return)&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">I look forward to funding your business soon.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><b>{!User.CompanyName}</b></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>